    <li>\(\ce{2SO3}(g) \rightleftharpoons \ce{2SO2}(g)+\ce{O2}(g) \hspace{20px} K_c=0.230\); [SO<sub>3</sub>] = 0.00 <em>M</em>, [SO<sub>2</sub>] = 1.00 <em>M</em>, [O<sub>2</sub>] = 1.00 <em>M</em></li>
