<p>(a) &Delta;<em>T</em> increase = shift right, &Delta;<em>P</em> increase = shift left; (b) &Delta;<em>T</em> increase = shift right, &Delta;<em>P</em> increase = no effect; (c) &Delta;<em>T</em> increase = shift left, &Delta;<em>P</em> increase = shift left; (d) &Delta;<em>T</em> increase = shift left, &Delta;<em>P</em> increase = shift right.</p>


