    <li>What will happen to the concentrations of N<sub>2</sub>, O<sub>2</sub>, and NO at equilibrium if the temperature of the system is increased?</li>
    <li>What will happen to the concentrations of N<sub>2</sub>, O<sub>2</sub>, and NO at equilibrium if a catalyst is added?</li>
