</ol>


</div><div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Exercises:_General_Chemistry/Exercises:_OpenStax/13.E:_Fundamental_Equilibrium_Concepts_(Exercises)" class="mt-section" id="section_71"><span id="Q13.3.14"></span><h3 id="Q13.3.14-44118">Q13.3.14</h3>


<p>Ammonia is a weak base that reacts with water according to this equation:</p>

