<p class="mt-align-center">\(\ce{CoO}(s)+\ce{CO}(g)&#8652;\ce{Co}(s)+\ce{CO2}(g) \hspace{20px} K_c=4.90&times;10^2\textrm{ at 550 &deg;C}\)</p>

